# Local Nix Flake Input Overrides
# ================================
# Copy to .env and uncomment the lines you need.
# After modifying .env, run `direnv reload` or re-enter the directory.
#
# See: https://github.com/blocksense-network/direnv-nix-flake-overrides

# Override nix-blockchain-development with local sibling checkout
# NIX_FLAKE_OVERRIDE_INPUTS='mcl-blockchain=path:../nix-blockchain-development'
